{"id":"simplemente","lemma":"simplemente","pos":"adv","rank":357,"glosses":["simply"],"ipa":"/ˌsimpleˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-simplemente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Simplemente hablen con Tom.","en":"Just talk to Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799379"},{"text":"Simplemente no es justo.","en":"It's just not fair.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/74792"},{"text":"Simplemente no lo sé.","en":"I simply don't know.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/212771"},{"text":"Esto simplemente podría funcionar.","en":"This might just work.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800865"},{"text":"¿No puedes simplemente arreglarlo?","en":"Can't you just fix it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454657"}]}